{"schemaVersion":1,"workId":"OL17846238W","title":"Eight cousins","authors":["Louisa May Alcott"],"firstPublished":1874,"edition":{"description":"Sections as detected in Project Gutenberg eBook #2726.","source":"Project Gutenberg eBook #2726","url":"https://www.gutenberg.org/ebooks/2726"},"sectionLabel":{"singular":"Chapter","plural":"Chapters"},"sections":[{"id":"s1","label":"Ch. 1","title":"Two Girls"},{"id":"s2","label":"Ch. 2","title":"The Clan"},{"id":"s3","label":"Ch. 3","title":"Uncles"},{"id":"s4","label":"Ch. 4","title":"Aunts"},{"id":"s5","label":"Ch. 5","title":"A Belt and a Box"},{"id":"s6","label":"Ch. 6","title":"Uncle Alec's Room"},{"id":"s7","label":"Ch. 7","title":"A Trip to China"},{"id":"s8","label":"Ch. 8","title":"And what came of it"},{"id":"s9","label":"Ch. 9","title":"Phebe's Secret"},{"id":"s10","label":"Ch. 10","title":"Rose's Sacrifice"},{"id":"s11","label":"Ch. 11","title":"Poor Mac"},{"id":"s12","label":"Ch. 12","title":"“The Other Fellows”"},{"id":"s13","label":"Ch. 13","title":"Cosey Corner"},{"id":"s14","label":"Ch. 14","title":"A Happy Birthday"},{"id":"s15","label":"Ch. 15","title":"Ear-Rings"},{"id":"s16","label":"Ch. 16","title":"Bread and Button-Holes"},{"id":"s17","label":"Ch. 17","title":"Good Bargains"},{"id":"s18","label":"Ch. 18","title":"Fashion and Physiology"},{"id":"s19","label":"Ch. 19","title":"Brother Bones"},{"id":"s20","label":"Ch. 20","title":"Under The Mistletoe"},{"id":"s21","label":"Ch. 21","title":"A Scare"},{"id":"s22","label":"Ch. 22","title":"Something to do"},{"id":"s23","label":"Ch. 23","title":"Peace-Making"},{"id":"s24","label":"Ch. 24","title":"Which?"}],"characters":[{"id":"rose","name":"Rose","role":"protagonist","firstAppearance":"s1","summary":"First mention: “Rose sat all alone in the big best parlor, with her little handkerchief laid ready to catch the first tear, for she was thinking of her troubles, and a shower was expected.”"},{"id":"phebe","name":"Phebe","role":"major","firstAppearance":"s1","summary":"First mention: ““Yes, indeed, if you want to,” answered Phebe, wringing out her cloth in a capable sort of way that impressed Rose very much.”"},{"id":"mac","name":"Mac","aliases":["Uncle Mac"],"role":"supporting","firstAppearance":"s2","summary":"First mention: “This old fellow is Mac, the bookworm, called Worm for short.”"},{"id":"dr-alec","name":"Dr. Alec","role":"supporting","firstAppearance":"s3","summary":"First mention: “Now we'll see what mischief these blessed women have been at.” And, making a long arm, Dr.”"},{"id":"charlie","name":"Charlie","role":"supporting","firstAppearance":"s2","summary":"First mention: “answered Charlie, looking much elated at her praise.”"},{"id":"archie","name":"Archie","role":"supporting","firstAppearance":"s2","summary":"First mention: “This is the Clan come to welcome you; and I'm the chief, Archie, at your service.””"},{"id":"uncle-alec","name":"Uncle Alec","role":"supporting","firstAppearance":"s1","summary":"First mention: ““Yes, but you see that is another trouble, for I don't know Uncle Alec at all.”"},{"id":"aunt-plenty","name":"Aunt Plenty","role":"supporting","firstAppearance":"s1","summary":"First mention: “Aunt Plenty had even allowed Rose to rummage in her great china closet a spicy retreat, rich in all the “goodies” that children love; but Rose seemed to care little for these toothsome temptations; and when that hope…”"},{"id":"jamie","name":"Jamie","role":"supporting","firstAppearance":"s2","summary":"First mention: “These are the Brats, my brothers, Geordie and Will, and Jamie the Baby.”"},{"id":"steve","name":"Steve","role":"supporting","firstAppearance":"s2","summary":"First mention: “This sweet creature is Steve the Dandy.”"},{"id":"aunt-myra","name":"Aunt Myra","aliases":["Myra"],"role":"minor","firstAppearance":"s1","summary":"First mention: ““I do hope it isn't Aunt Myra; she always scares me out of my wits asking how my cough is, and groaning over me as if I was going to die,” said Rose, preparing to retire the way she came, for the slide, being cut for…”"},{"id":"prince","name":"Prince","role":"minor","firstAppearance":"s2","summary":"First mention: ““How is that, my lassie?” asked the Prince, coming up all flushed and breathless when the ballet was over.”"},{"id":"aunt-jessie","name":"Aunt Jessie","role":"minor","firstAppearance":"s3","summary":"First mention: “This was the only uncle Rose had met for years, for Uncle Jem and Uncle Steve, the husbands of Aunt Jessie and Aunt Clara, were at sea, and Aunt Myra was a widow.”"},{"id":"geordie","name":"Geordie","role":"minor","firstAppearance":"s2","summary":"First mention: “These are the Brats, my brothers, Geordie and Will, and Jamie the Baby.”"},{"id":"pokey","name":"Pokey","role":"minor","firstAppearance":"s6","summary":"First mention: ““Mamma, don't you think Pokey would like some of my shells?”"},{"id":"mrs-jessie","name":"Mrs. Jessie","role":"minor","firstAppearance":"s4","summary":"First mention: ““I'll do my best, Alec; and I think you will need me, for, wise as you are, you cannot understand a tender, timid little creature like Rose as a woman can,” said Mrs.”"},{"id":"aunt-peace","name":"Aunt Peace","role":"minor","firstAppearance":"s1","summary":"First mention: “This suited her better than anything else, but it was not good for her, and she grew pale, heavy-eyed and listless, though Aunt Plenty gave her iron enough to make a cooking-stove, and Aunt Peace petted her like a poo…”"},{"id":"aunt-clara","name":"Aunt Clara","role":"minor","firstAppearance":"s2","summary":"First mention: “This big one is Prince Charlie, Aunt Clara's boy.”"},{"id":"ariadne","name":"Ariadne","role":"minor","firstAppearance":"s1","summary":"First mention: “So prim little Ariadne was sent home, and the exhausted aunties left Rose to her own devices for a day or two.”"},{"id":"aunt-jane","name":"Aunt Jane","role":"minor","firstAppearance":"s2","summary":"First mention: “They are Aunt Jane's lads, and a precious pair you'd better believe.”"},{"id":"mrs-clara","name":"Mrs. Clara","role":"minor","firstAppearance":"s18","summary":"First mention: ““Now she looks like other girls, and as I like to see her,” Mrs.”"},{"id":"miss-rose","name":"Miss Rose","role":"minor","firstAppearance":"s1","summary":"First mention: ““You are wanted in the parlor, Miss Rose.””"},{"id":"debby","name":"Debby","role":"minor","firstAppearance":"s1","summary":"First mention: “Debby wants some one to help round, and I've come to try for a week.””"},{"id":"dandy","name":"Dandy","role":"minor","firstAppearance":"s2","summary":"First mention: “This sweet creature is Steve the Dandy.”"},{"id":"mum","name":"Mum","role":"minor","firstAppearance":"s6","summary":"First mention: “little Mum!”"},{"id":"arch","name":"Arch","role":"minor","firstAppearance":"s9","summary":"First mention: “Arch and I are rather past that kind of thing now, but we do it to please the children,” added Charlie, with a sudden recollection of his sixteen years.”"},{"id":"mother-atkinson","name":"Mother Atkinson","role":"minor","firstAppearance":"s13","summary":"First mention: “Mother Atkinson, as all called their hostess, was the merriest there, and the busiest; for she kept flying up to wait on the children, to bring out some new dish, or to banish the live stock, who were of such a social…”"},{"id":"ben","name":"Ben","role":"minor","firstAppearance":"s3","summary":"First mention: ““I'll send Ben up the hill, and you can step over to Myra's yourself; it will please her, and you will have plenty of time.””"},{"id":"miss-blish","name":"Miss Blish","role":"minor","firstAppearance":"s15","summary":"First mention: ““I'll see Miss Blish,” and immediately put on her company face, pulled out her locket, and settled her curls.”"},{"id":"uncle-jem","name":"Uncle Jem","role":"minor","firstAppearance":"s3","summary":"First mention: “This was the only uncle Rose had met for years, for Uncle Jem and Uncle Steve, the husbands of Aunt Jessie and Aunt Clara, were at sea, and Aunt Myra was a widow.”"},{"id":"barkis","name":"Barkis","role":"minor","firstAppearance":"s14","summary":"First mention: ““Barkis” was so gentle and so “willin',” however, that Rose was ashamed to be afraid to ride him; so she had learned, that she might surprise Dr.”"},{"id":"miss-power","name":"Miss Power","role":"minor","firstAppearance":"s1","summary":"First mention: “The more I got, the more Miss Power gave me, and I was so miserable that I 'most cried my eyes out.”"}],"relationships":[{"id":"r1","source":"aunt-plenty","target":"rose","weight":50,"phases":[{"at":"s1","type":"together","label":"Appear together","weight":3,"note":"First named together in Ch. 1."},{"at":"s3","type":"together","label":"Often together","weight":12},{"at":"s18","type":"together","label":"Constantly together","weight":40}]},{"id":"r2","source":"ariadne","target":"rose","weight":22,"phases":[{"at":"s1","type":"together","label":"Appear together","weight":1,"note":"First named together in Ch. 1."},{"at":"s15","type":"together","label":"Often together","weight":22}]},{"id":"r3","source":"aunt-peace","target":"rose","weight":24,"phases":[{"at":"s1","type":"together","label":"Appear together","weight":2,"note":"First named together in Ch. 1."},{"at":"s5","type":"together","label":"Often together","weight":14}]},{"id":"r4","source":"aunt-peace","target":"aunt-plenty","weight":14,"phases":[{"at":"s1","type":"together","label":"Appear together","weight":2,"note":"First named together in Ch. 1."},{"at":"s21","type":"together","label":"Often together","weight":12}]},{"id":"r5","source":"phebe","target":"rose","weight":141,"phases":[{"at":"s1","type":"together","label":"Often together","weight":12},{"at":"s5","type":"together","label":"Constantly together","weight":42}]},{"id":"r6","source":"debby","target":"rose","weight":10,"phases":[{"at":"s1","type":"together","label":"Appear together","weight":6,"note":"First named together in Ch. 1."}]},{"id":"r7","source":"miss-power","target":"r